# Paranal Airglow Line And Continuum Emission (PALACE) model: data and code of
# v1.0 (Noll et al. 2024)
# 
# List of lines/multiplets/features with measured X-shooter/UVES time series
# that were used for the derivation of the PALACE reference climatologies
# (includes results from noll+19, noll+23, and noll+24)
# 
# Column names:
# feat: label of line/multiplet/feature
# lam: central vacuum wavelength in µm (source: HITRAN2020 for molecules,
#      NIST for atoms, or noll+24 for continuum features)
# dlam: distance from lam to lower und upper wavelength limit in µm
#       (multiplet: defined by distribution of component wavelengths,
#       continuum feature: defined by integration range)
# Nlin: number of components (99 for continuum feature)
# I: reference intensity from climatology in R
# class: label of variability class
# 
# References:
# HITRAN2020: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jqsrt.2021.107949
# NIST: https://physics.nist.gov/asd
# noll+19: https://doi.org/10.1029/2018JD030044 (only KI0770)
# noll+23: https://doi.org/10.1029/2022JD038275 (OH at > 1.005 µm)
# noll+24: https://doi.org/10.5194/acp-24-1143-2024 (continuum features)
# 
